############### Epstein File Manager ###############

A lightweight portable file manager for Windows.

Built for fast PDF browsing, file downloads, and search workflows across released dataset files.

---

############### Features ###############

• Fast file browsing  
• Built-in PDF viewer  
• Search / scan function for words, multiple terms, and exact phrases  
• Download manager  
• Portable executable (no installation required)  
• GitHub auto updater  
• Lightweight design  
• Clean UI  

---

############### Download ###############

Get the latest version here:

https://github.com/EinhornLab/Epstein-FileManager/releases

---

############### Requirements ###############

Windows 10 / Windows 11  
64-bit system

---

############### Project Status ###############

Currently in active development.

The project is being expanded with improved search, scanning, and workflow features.
